==German==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|de|gmh|argern||worsen}}, from {{inh|de|goh|argerōn}}. Derived from {{der|de|goh|arg|t=bad}}, from {{der|de|gem-pro|*argaz}}. Compare English {{m|en|eerie}}.

