===Verb===
{{de-verb}}

# {{lb|de|transitive}} to [[annoy]], to [[make]] [[angry]] (''+accusative'')
#: {{syn|de|nerven}}
#: {{ux|de|Die anderen Kinder '''ärgern''' ihn immer.|The other kids keep '''annoying''' him.}}
# {{lb|de|reflexive}} to [[be]] [[annoyed]], to [[be]] [[angry]], to [[get]] [[annoyed]], to [[get]] [[angry]]

